          "headline": "China confirms Xi will host Trump and Putin in Shenzhen on Thursday, Nov 19",
          "summary": "China's foreign ministry confirmed on Monday that Xi Jinping will hold the first three-way meeting with Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin in Shenzhen on November 19, alongside the APEC summit. New since the weekend: Beijing has now confirmed the date; the White House and Kremlin had already agreed. No agenda was given; US officials say Trump wants to discuss nuclear arms cuts and Iran.",
