          "headline": "Sensex up about 400 points at midday as banks and IT lead; FIIs keep buying",
          "summary": "The Sensex was at 81,999.63 (+0.5%) and the Nifty at 25,251.60 (+0.4%) around 1:30 PM, after the Sensex touched 82,227 in the morning. SBI, Kotak Mahindra Bank, Bharti Airtel and Asian Paints led gains; metal and realty stocks lagged. Foreign investors bought Rs 5,736 crore of shares on Friday while domestic funds sold for an 11th day.",
